      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did have someone look at it but they just said the escapement was old and needed oiling... but they didnt see what i see. it happens at the exact same time every day. like, every day at 2:14 PM the pendulum has this heavy, double-thud pause before it resumes. and then again, much more subtle, at 8:47 PM. it's too consistent to be just a mechanical glitch. if we look at the dates or specific events that happened at these exact times in history, do u see any link? i really feel like there's a connection here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
